<section class="process-band section" aria-labelledby="process-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 id="process-title">Give the work somewhere to start.</h2><p>
        A first project gives us something concrete to learn from.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ol class="process-list">
      <li>
        <span class="process-number" aria-hidden="true">1</span><h3>Choose a goal</h3><p>
          Agree what matters to the business, who needs to be involved, and what a useful outcome
          would look like.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="process-number" aria-hidden="true">2</span><h3>Test the assumptions</h3><p>
          Use a small experiment to answer an important question. Bring the evidence back to the
          people making the decision.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="process-number" aria-hidden="true">3</span><h3>Build with your team</h3><p>
          Develop what works. Establish who will own it, and help them maintain and extend it.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
